otal_blocking":0},"body":"I list some additional format cases that RustPython does not support.\r\n\r\n```\r\n'{:f}'.format(False)\r\n'{:x}'.format(False)\r\n'{:X}'.format(False)\r\n'{:e}'.format(False)\r\n'{:E}'.format(False)\r\n'{:c}'.format(False)\r\n'{:g}'.format(False)\r\n'{:o}'.format(False)\r\n'{:%}'.format(False)\r\n'{:o}'.format(False)\r\n```\r\n\r\nRustPython reports VauleError:\r\n```\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/xxm/Desktop/RustPython/test.py\", line 104, in <module>\r\n    '{:o}'.format(False)\r\nValueError: Invalid format specifier\r\n```\r\n\r\nEnvironment:\r\nUbuntu 18.04\r\nRustPython 0.2.0 [fa79055](https://github.com/RustPython/RustPython/commit/fa790558211ec690541299258f44d7453501958a)\r\nCPython 3.8.0, 3.9.0, 3.11.3\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4950/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}